## Data and factual sources

No third-party dataset is redistributed in this repository. Figures cited in the project
materials are quoted with attribution from public regulatory and industry documents, and
each source is recorded with its terms, its exact attribution and its verification status
in `DATA-SOURCES.md` in the project workspace. Sources include publications of the
Luxembourg CSSF, ESMA and the US SEC, plus published analysis by Deloitte Luxembourg and
Morgan Lewis, each attributed in place.

